        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213924/Homie-tried-to-punch-me-and-fell-and-tore-his-whole-damn-ACL",
        "content_text": "Las Vegas street performer King Trot was freestyling when a hooligan ran up and tried to attack him, but before the assailant could reach his target, he slipped and fell over, injuring his knee. He had no choice but to sit on the ground and listen to King Trot <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/XabN_jhL19I\">mock him in rap for several minutes until the paramedics arrived.</a> (SLYT)",
