        "url": "https://www.metafilter.com/213918/Tracking-the-journeys-of-the-characters-felt-like-a-simple-suggestion",
        "content_text": "Peter Guillam and his daughter have used the Claude LLM to create a tool for mapping characters' journeys in novels, <a href=\"https://peter-guillam123.github.io/plotlines/index.html\">PlotLines</a>. He writes about the process <a href=\"https://peter-guillam123.github.io/plotlines/essay.html\">here</a>. His <a href=\"https://peter-guillam123.github.io\">other tools</a> include a Hansard search and a map of redundant churches.</a>",
        "type": "Internet",
        "source": "MetaFilter"
