        "url": "https://9to5mac.com/2026/07/22/apples-huge-mac-roadmap-revealed-in-new-report/",
        "content_text": "<div class=\"feat-image\"><img src=\"https://9to5mac.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/6/2024/10/m4-imac-vs-m3-imac-colors.jpeg?quality=82&#038;strip=all&#038;w=1600\" /></div><p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">A new report from <a href=\"https://www.bloomberg.com/news/articles/2026-07-22/apple-to-launch-new-macbook-air-imac-macbook-pro-neo-mac-mini-mac-studio?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=author_alert&amp;utm_term=260722&amp;utm_campaign=author_19842959\"><em>Bloomberg</em> today</a> offers an in-depth look at Apple’s Mac pipeline. The report details updates coming to the MacBook Pro, MacBook Air, iMac, and much more over the next several years.</p>",
